      "source_quote": "9.6    Committee Terms of Reference\n\n             MOVED BY: SZPAK\n             SECONDED: GUIRY\n\n             THAT Council approve the proposed terms of reference in form and content included with\n             this report, excepting minor changes;\n\n             AND\n\n             That Council appoint Councillor Wagner, Councillor Szpak, and Councillor Guiry, to the\n             Sustainable Development Advisory Committee;\n\n             AND\n\n             That Council appoint Councillor Morley, Councillor Yacucha, and Councillor Harder, to the\n             Community Advisory Committee;\n\n             AND\n\n             That Council direct staff to post the committee positions to the City's website and in the\n             Goldstream Gazette for interested members of the community to apply.\n\n                                                                                            Motion CARRIED.",
      "pdf_page": 8,
      "effective_from": "2023-02-21"
    },
